# Preamble for KMP package
# This file defines the package description and requirements

Summary:        Kernel module for Motorcomm YT6801 ethernet controller
Group:          System/Kernel
Provides:       %{mod_name}-kmp = %version-%release
Requires:       coreutils
Supplements:    modalias(pci:v00001F0Ad00006801sv*sd*bc*sc*i*)

%description
This package contains the kernel module for the Motorcomm YT6801 gigabit
ethernet controller. This driver provides support for YT6801-based network
adapters found in various TUXEDO laptops and other systems.

The module is built specifically for your running kernel and will be automatically
rebuilt when you install kernel updates through OpenSUSE's package management.
